{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "chat.history({ limit?, regex?, source?, since_ms? })。v1.6 读聊天记录。\n\n动机（用户2026-11-01）：某些提示（登录插件 ``✔ 登录成功``、Baritone 的\n``Going to: …``、模组自己的提示）只在**客户端聊天框**里出现，10 秒淡出，\n靠截图\"发完立刻截\"根本不可靠。\n\n``source``：``server``（服务端聊天，与 events 事件的 chat 同源）/\n``client``（客户端本地消息：**Baritone 回执**、模组提示、指令反馈）/\n``all``（缺省，按时间合并）。``regex`` 是 Java 正则，按整行匹配过滤。",
  "properties": {
    "limit": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "maximum": 200,
          "minimum": 1,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Limit"
    },
    "regex": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Regex"
    },
    "source": {
      "default": "all",
      "enum": [
        "all",
        "server",
        "client"
      ],
      "title": "Source",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "since_ms": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Since Ms"
    }
  },
  "title": "ChatHistoryParams",
  "type": "object"
}
